  "note": "The arrival direction of the CR 713.8c case: a perpetual grant naming one of the two cards the meld consumes follows onto the permanent they become (CR 701.42a puts both onto the battlefield, a CR 400.7 new object). Pearl Collector grants lifelink to Hanweir Garrison; --battlements grants it to Hanweir Battlements, made a creature Collector can target by Badgermole Cub's earthbend, so an engine re-anchoring only the first component the meld records answers the two differently; the earthbend's return trigger then finds no card to return. Each has a control granting lifelink with Heliod, Sun-Crowned's until-end-of-turn ability instead, which CR 400.7 leaves behind.",
